{"id":"P052-2","subject":"P","unit":"P052","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P052-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n이상적인 전류원와 전압원의 내부저항에 대한 설명으로 옳\n\n은 것은?\n\n\n① 이상적인 전류원과 전압원의 내부저항은 모두 0이다.\n\n② 이상적인 전류원의 내부저항은 ∞, 전압원의 내부저항은\n\n  0이다.\n\n③ 이상적인 전류원과 전압원의 내부저항은 모두 ∞이다.\n\n④ 이상적인 전류원의 내부저항은 0, 전압원의 내부저항은\n\n  ∞이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":464}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음과 같은 RLC회로에서 Ω,     H ,                        \n\n            때, 선택도는 얼마인가?pF일\n\n(단, 회로는 공진상태이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 20          ② 25\n\n③ 50          ④ 100","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":702},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1017}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n한 상의 저항이 Ω, 리액턴스가 Ω인\n\n3상 성형결선 부하에 400V의 상전압을 인가하면 몇\n\nA 의 부하전류가 흐르는가?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":538},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":402},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":987}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n정현파 전류 sin°A 가 어느 순간에 순싯\n\n값과 실횻값이 같아졌다. 이 때의 는?\n\n\n\n\n① 45          ② 50\n\n③ 60          ④ 80","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":568},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":897}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n‘회로 ㉠’과 같은 △결선 부하를 ‘회로 ㉡’의 Y결선으로\n등가변환하는 경우, 는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n       < 회로 ㉠ >             < 회로 ㉡ >\n\n\n\n① 4           ② 16\n\n③ 24          ④ 36","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":857},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1272}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n1차측의 전압이 6600V, 권수비 30인 단상 변압기로 부\n\n하에 30A 를 공급할 때, 변압기의 입력은 몇 kVA 인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 3.3          ② 4.4\n\n③ 5.5          ④ 6.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":458},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":610}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n불평형 3상 전류가 A , A,\nA 일 때의 영상전류 A 는?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":572},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1246}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n자기 인덕턴스가 2H 인 코일에 A 의\n\n전류를 흘릴 때, 코일 양단에 걸리는 단자전압은 몇 V인\n\n가?\n\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":696},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":636}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n다음 그림과 같은 접지시스템의 종류는 무엇인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 단독접지       ② 종별접지\n\n③ 공통접지       ④ 통합접지","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":615},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n공통접지공사 적용시 선도체의 단면적()이 ≦\nmm일 때, 선도체와 같은 매질의 보호도체의 최소 단면\n적은 몇 mm이상이어야 하는가?\n\n\n①            ② \n\n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":572},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1471}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n전압의 구분에서 저압, 고압의 구분으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 저압은 교류의 경우 1kV이하, 직류의 경우 1.5kV\n\n  이하를 말한다.\n\n② 저압은 교류의 경우 600V이하, 직류의 경우 1kV\n\n  이하를 말한다.\n\n③ 고압은 교류의 경우 600V초과 7kV이하, 직류의\n\n  경우 1kV초과 7kV이하를 말한다.\n\n④ 고압은 교류의 경우 1kV초과 9kV이하, 직류의\n\n  경우 1.5kV초과 9kV이하를 말한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":411}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n계통의 일부분에서 PEN도체를 사용하거나, 중성선과\n\n별도의 PE도체를 사용하는 방식이 있으며, 배전계통에서\n\nPEN도체와 PE도체를 추가로 접지할 수 있는 계통접지는\n\n무엇인가?\n\n\n① TN-S계통       ② TT계통\n\n③ IT계통        ④ TN-C-S계통","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m37-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1282}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n접지도체를 구리 또는 철제로 하고 접지도체에 피뢰시스템\n\n이 접속되는 경우, 각 도체로 구성되는 접지도체의\n최소단면적은 몇 mm이상인가?\n\n\n\n       구리          철제\n\n ①           2.5                16\n\n ②          4                 16\n\n ③          6                 50\n\n ④         16                50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":712},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":602}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n전기자동차 전원공급 설비의 저압전로 시설에 관한 규정으\n\n로 옳지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 옥내에 시설하는 저압용의 배선기구는 그 충전 부분이\n\n  노출되지 않도록 시설해야 한다.\n\n② 옥내에 시설하는 저압용의 비포장 퓨즈는 난연성의\n\n  것으로 제작한 함 내부에 시설해야 한다.\n\n③ 저압 콘센트는 접지극이 있는 콘센트를 사용하여 접지\n\n  하여야 한다.\n\n④ 옥내의 습기가 많은 곳 또는 물기가 있는 곳에 시설\n\n  하는 저압용의 배선기구에는 방습장치를 하여야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":803},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m39-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1403}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n외부피뢰시스템의 구성에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 수뢰부        ② 인하도선\n\n③ 접지극        ④ 서지보호장치","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":368},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":479}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n태양전지에서 출력되는 직류전력을 교류전력으로 변환하는\n\n인버터의 기능에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 최저전력 추종제어기능\n\n② 자동운전 정지기능\n\n③ 단독운전 방지기능\n\n④ 계통연계 보호기능","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m41-e1.webp","width":696,"height":723}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n1kW의 전열기를 이용하여 4L의 물 20°C를 63°C\n\n로 올리는데 걸리는 시간은 몇 분인가?\n\n(단, 전열기의 효율은 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 5분          ② 10분\n\n③ 15분         ④ 20분","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1159}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n가로, 세로의 길이가 각각 15m 및 10m인 방에서 광\n\n속이 3000lm, 조명률이 0.6, 감광보상률이 1.6인 등을\n\n20개 설치할 때, 평균조도는 몇 lx인가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 150\n\n③ 200         ④ 250","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m43-e1.webp","width":678,"height":716}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n면적이 25m인 방에 전등 25개를 설치하여 평균조도가\n\n300lx가 되게 하려면, 전등의 광속은 몇 lm인가?\n\n(단, 조명률은 0.6, 보수율은 0.8이다.)\n\n\n① 120         ② 375\n\n③ 625         ④ 1600","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m44-q.webp","width":696,"height":687},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":568}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P052-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n다음 그림과 같이 계통의 차단기가 동작되어 계통이 분리\n\n된 상태에서 상태에서 분산형 전원이 다른 계통에 연계되\n\n어 전원을 공급하고 있는 것을 의미하는 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 역송 병렬운전     ② 보호계전\n\n③ 계통연계       ④ 단독운전","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.09.01 원자력환경공단 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h2-e11-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m45-q.webp","width":696,"height":1195},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e11-m45-e1.webp","width":678,"height":599}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
